cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite the paper below."
title: "GaugeAlign: Gauge Canonicalization for Multi-Camera 3D Perception under Sim-to-Real Transfer"
abstract: >-
  First-place solution to Track 1 (Multi-Camera 3D Perception, Sim2Real) of the
  2026 AI City Challenge. Identifies the anchor-gauge coupling, a geometric
  failure mode in which a query-based 3D detector's learned spatial prior binds
  it to the training world frame, and repairs it with a closed-form, label-free,
  exactly invertible scene canonicalization operator applied at inference time.
